{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**1. Contradictions**\n- #9/#4 require a per-`cwd` cross-process lock; `job_registry` only has in-process `path_lock`. → **Supervisor holds `flock`; MCP unchanged until #13.**\n- Spec stories 12–13 vs #7 “MCP `job_registry` untouched”: CLI lock won’t block MCP `cursor_run`. → **File lock is authoritative for `cwd`; document dual-interface gap until #13.**\n- #7: read-write → `--sandbox disabled`; `capability.rs` `Write` stays sandboxed. → **CLI maps read-write to unsandboxed path only.**\n- `status_record.rs` uses `cursor-delegate-jobs`; #7 rules `delegate-jobs`. → **Supervisor uses #7 path.**\n- #7 adds `supervisorPid` / `heartbeatAt` / `resume` on records; `PollResult` lacks them. → **Extend serialized record per #7.**\n\n**2. #9 unstated defaults**\n- Lock file location and payload. → **`$TMPDIR/delegate-locks/<canonical-cwd-hash>.lock` with holder `jobId`.**\n- Model-idle when only `--tool-idle-ms` is set. → **Host-profile `idleMs` / `toolIdleMs` (MCP defaults 300s / 1800s).**\n- `--gate` invocation. → **Reuse `gate::run_gate` (`sh -c`).**\n- CLI BUSY shape and exit code. → **JSON like `DispatchResult::Busy`; non-zero exit TBD—mirror `run` success semantics.**\n- Lock key for `--cwd`. → **`resolve_path` canonical path.**\n\n**3. Failure cases (unspecified)**\n- Dead supervisor, RUNNING record (#7 deferred to #9). → **Stale heartbeat; `watch` timeout exit 1; optional lock break on dead pid.**\n- `FileStatusRecordWriter` swallows write errors. → **#7: supervisor exits non-zero.**\n- Gate hangs (`timeout_ms: None`). → **Define gate timeout or inherit profile `deadlineMs`.**\n- Non-git / `git_delta` failure. → **Omit `change_set`; don’t fail job.**\n- Stall after watchdog: no `gate_result`. → **Expected; gate only after normal agent exit.**\n\n**4. Acceptance criteria tensions**\n- AC: two `delegate run` processes; tests are MCP `e2e.rs` only. → **CLI process e2e required in #9.**\n- AC: gate in “terminal record”; `finalize_stall` skips gate. → **Gate AC applies to non-stall completions only.**\n- #4 probe: change-set must count commits; `allow_partial_commit` is MCP-named. → **Expose CLI flag; always list commits in `change_set`.**\n- Blocked by #7 but AC covers gate/lock/watchdog. → **Land #7 first; #9 extends supervisor only.**\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS"}]},"session_id":"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":70188,"duration_api_ms":70188,"is_error":false,"result":"Gathering issues #9, #4, and #7 (with comments) and reading the referenced source files.\n\n\n**1. Contradictions**\n- #9/#4 require a per-`cwd` cross-process lock; `job_registry` only has in-process `path_lock`. → **Supervisor holds `flock`; MCP unchanged until #13.**\n- Spec stories 12–13 vs #7 “MCP `job_registry` untouched”: CLI lock won’t block MCP `cursor_run`. → **File lock is authoritative for `cwd`; document dual-interface gap until #13.**\n- #7: read-write → `--sandbox disabled`; `capability.rs` `Write` stays sandboxed. → **CLI maps read-write to unsandboxed path only.**\n- `status_record.rs` uses `cursor-delegate-jobs`; #7 rules `delegate-jobs`. → **Supervisor uses #7 path.**\n- #7 adds `supervisorPid` / `heartbeatAt` / `resume` on records; `PollResult` lacks them. → **Extend serialized record per #7.**\n\n**2. #9 unstated defaults**\n- Lock file location and payload. → **`$TMPDIR/delegate-locks/<canonical-cwd-hash>.lock` with holder `jobId`.**\n- Model-idle when only `--tool-idle-ms` is set. → **Host-profile `idleMs` / `toolIdleMs` (MCP defaults 300s / 1800s).**\n- `--gate` invocation. → **Reuse `gate::run_gate` (`sh -c`).**\n- CLI BUSY shape and exit code. → **JSON like `DispatchResult::Busy`; non-zero exit TBD—mirror `run` success semantics.**\n- Lock key for `--cwd`. → **`resolve_path` canonical path.**\n\n**3. Failure cases (unspecified)**\n- Dead supervisor, RUNNING record (#7 deferred to #9). → **Stale heartbeat; `watch` timeout exit 1; optional lock break on dead pid.**\n- `FileStatusRecordWriter` swallows write errors. → **#7: supervisor exits non-zero.**\n- Gate hangs (`timeout_ms: None`). → **Define gate timeout or inherit profile `deadlineMs`.**\n- Non-git / `git_delta` failure. → **Omit `change_set`; don’t fail job.**\n- Stall after watchdog: no `gate_result`. → **Expected; gate only after normal agent exit.**\n\n**4. Acceptance criteria tensions**\n- AC: two `delegate run` processes; tests are MCP `e2e.rs` only. → **CLI process e2e required in #9.**\n- AC: gate in “terminal record”; `finalize_stall` skips gate. → **Gate AC applies to non-stall completions only.**\n- #4 probe: change-set must count commits; `allow_partial_commit` is MCP-named. → **Expose CLI flag; always list commits in `change_set`.**\n- Blocked by #7 but AC covers gate/lock/watchdog. → **Land #7 first; #9 extends supervisor only.**\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS","session_id":"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a","request_id":"a09b1b3c-34aa-45b4-baad-9b84151ab3b9","usage":{"inputTokens":43810,"outputTokens":4174,"cacheReadTokens":408541,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
